message: "If you use Ernie in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Ernie: Efficient Renderer for Natural and Interplanetary Environments"
abstract: "A physically accurate, real-time, spectral renderer for interplanetary environments, with C++ and Python APIs, built for camera and sensor simulation in planetary robotics and batched rendering for reinforcement learning."
type: software
authors:
